      "creator_notes": "A quick shitpost generator card. Tested on LumenPrompt Simple 1.3. \r\n\r\nIf you want to find more cards by me, visit https://illuminaryidiot.neocities.org/ or https://characterhub.org/users/illuminaryidiot\r\nMy presets can be found on my Neocities, which I use to test all my cards.",
      "system_prompt": "",
      "post_history_instructions": "In every reply, you will write out a newsletter for the game Deltarune, which is currently in development.\r\nGenerate it based on the title I have provided in the <input> tag.\r\nBegin your reply with a title and date.\r\nImages, videos and other non-text content are all marked in hard brackets.\r\nUse the example in the <example> tag as a basis for how to format the newsletter. Always emulate the tone laid out in the <example> tag. Feel free to experiment with length and contents, but always keep a light-hearted, innocuous tone.\r\nInside the <events> tag are events that will occur in your next reply.\r\n\r\n",
